  "descriptionHtml": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <div class=\"jss96\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <div class=\"MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthXl\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <div class=\"MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-spacing-xs-4\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <div class=\"MuiGrid-root jss102 MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-lg-6\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <div class=\"jss105\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <p class=\"MuiTypography-root jss108 MuiTypography-body1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Velcro Patches for Backpacks are crafted to provide the premium appearance and feel of direct embroidery, paired with the versatility of interchangeable positioning. These patches blend the elegance of exquisite embroidery with the practicality of a Velcro backing, facilitating effortless attachment and detachment from backpacks or other gear. Opt for a refined thin-stitched edge for a sleek integration or select a robust Merrow border for enhanced durability.</span><br></p> <p class=\"MuiTypography-root jss108 MuiTypography-body1\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 600;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Each patch order includes a Free roll of Thermal Tape.</span></p> <p class=\"MuiTypography-root jss108 MuiTypography-body1 __prematched-text\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>Add a Premade Patch Sample to <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Cart - $0.01 - <a title=\"Add to Cart\" href=\"https://Patch%20Krazepatches.com/cart/add?id=46978094727487&amp;quantity=1\"><strong>Add to Cart</strong></a></span></p> <p class=\"MuiTypography-root jss108 MuiTypography-body1 __prematched-text\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
